sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as 📄 Docs2PdfView
    participant IPC as 🔌 src-tauri
    participant Sem as 🚦 docs_preview_semaphore (1)
    participant Engine as ⚙️ knit-docs (Typst / CDP / Office)
    participant PDFJS as 👁️ PdfJsPreview

    UI->>UI: Edit text / change option -> cancel previous preview token
    UI->>IPC: docs_preview_pdf_bytes(content, inputPath, inputKind, options)
    IPC->>IPC: Swap docs_preview_cancel (abort stale task)
    IPC->>Sem: Acquire 1-permit preview semaphore
    alt Markdown / PlainText / CodeFence
        Sem->>Engine: compile_text_to_pdf_bytes_with_cancel (Typst + ComemoEvictGuard)
    else HTML (Auto / DocumentPrint / SlideStep)
        Sem->>Engine: compile_html_via_browser_to_pdf_bytes (CDP or --print-to-pdf) else html_to_typst
    else EPUB
        Sem->>Engine: compile_epub_to_pdf_bytes (LAST_PARSED_EPUB cache)
    else DOCX / PPTX
        Sem->>Engine: compile_office_to_pdf_bytes (LAST_CONVERTED_OFFICE cache)
    end
    Engine->>Engine: trim_process_heap() / comemo::evict(2)
    Engine-->>PDFJS: Raw PDF bytes (ArrayBuffer) -> release off-screen canvas stores

    UI->>IPC: docs_convert_content_to_pdf / docs_convert_to_pdf(jobId, ...)
    IPC->>Engine: Atomic write output_path (.tmp -> rename)
    Engine-->>UI: DocConvertResult (page_count, bytes_written, used_external_engine)
